OL,3,AMicrosoft says email queues
OL,4,A'approaching normal levels' after
OL,5,Aglobal outage hits Outlook and Teams
OL,6,Ausers
OL,7,
OL,8,FMicrosoft says it's seeing
OL,9,F"improvements", with email queues
OL,10,F"approaching normal levels", after a
OL,11,Fglobal outage hit Teams, Outlook and AI
OL,12,Fsoftware Copilot
OL,14,FThe company says there's no evidence of
OL,15,F"malicious activity" and users may
OL,16,Fstill have "intermittent access issues"
OL,17,F- more than 20 hours since issues
OL,18,Fbegan, our tech reporter explains the
OL,19,Fglitches your inbox may still be
OL,20,Fexperiencing
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
